config REGULATOR_STM32H7_PWR
    bool "STM32H7 PWR regulators"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ST_STM32H747_PWR_ENABLED
    help
      Support for USB33, the supply of the USB transceivers, which the
      voltage detector of the STM32H7 PWR lets through.
